{
  "name": "Slack Customer Alert Router",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "customer-alert",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "CRM Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst alert = items[0].json;\n\nreturn [{json: {\n  severity: (alert.severity || 'low').toLowerCase(),\n  customer: alert.customer || 'Unknown',\n  issue: alert.issue || '',\n  description: alert.description || '',\n  accountValue: alert.accountValue || 0,\n  assignee: alert.assignee || '',\n  crmLink: alert.crmLink || '',\n  timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n}}];"
      },
      "name": "Parse Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "critical",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Critical"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.severity }}",
                    "rightValue": "high",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "High"
            }
          ],
          "fallbackOutput": {
            "renameOutput": true,
            "outputKey": "Normal"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Switch Severity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [700, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#critical-alerts",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":rotating_light: *CRITICAL CUSTOMER ALERT*\n\n*Customer:* {{ $json.customer }}\n*Issue:* {{ $json.issue }}\n*Account Value:* ${{ $json.accountValue }}\n*Details:* {{ $json.description }}\n*CRM:* {{ $json.crmLink }}\n\n@channel — Immediate attention required!",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Critical",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [960, 180],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#support-escalations",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":warning: *High Priority Alert*\n\n*Customer:* {{ $json.customer }}\n*Issue:* {{ $json.issue }}\n*Details:* {{ $json.description }}\n*CRM:* {{ $json.crmLink }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post High",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [960, 340],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#support",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": ":ticket: *Support Ticket*\n\n*Customer:* {{ $json.customer }}\n*Issue:* {{ $json.issue }}\n*Details:* {{ $json.description }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "Post Normal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [960, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.assignee }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": ":bell: You've been assigned a *{{ $json.severity }}* customer issue.\n\n*Customer:* {{ $json.customer }}\n*Issue:* {{ $json.issue }}\n*CRM:* {{ $json.crmLink }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "name": "DM Assignee",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1200, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Alert Tracking",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sheets Tracking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1420, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Customer Alert Router\n\nRoute customer alerts by severity level.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. CRM triggers webhook\n2. Parse and normalize alert data\n3. Switch by severity:\n   - Critical → #critical-alerts\n   - High → #support-escalations\n   - Normal → #support\n4. DM assigned support agent\n5. Log to Google Sheets\n\n**Webhook payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"severity\": \"critical\",\n  \"customer\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"issue\": \"Service outage\",\n  \"assignee\": \"U12345\",\n  \"accountValue\": 50000\n}\n```",
        "width": 340,
        "height": 400
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [20, 160]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "CRM Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Switch Severity",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Switch Severity": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Critical",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Post High",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Post Normal",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Critical": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DM Assignee",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post High": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DM Assignee",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Post Normal": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "DM Assignee",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "DM Assignee": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sheets Tracking",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}